      "status": "VERIFIED_WITH_CAVEAT",
      "supported": true,
      "correction": null,
      "caveat": "Customs IOR and CPSC certificate-responsible party must be kept separate. A broker acting as IOR may identify an owner, purchaser or consignee as the CPSC certificate-responsible party. Personal-use consumers are only 'not typically' treated as certification importers.",
