      "status": "VERIFIED_WITH_CAVEAT",
      "supported": true,
      "correction": null,
      "caveat": "The CPSA carve-out is role-specific: no-title logistics alone does not make the entity a manufacturer/distributor/retailer. It does not confer customs, transport-regulation or product-regime immunity.",
